# OpenRouter (required for TypeSafe JEV Decisions API)
# Only OPENROUTER_API_KEY is required. JEV URL/model below are documentation defaults;
# the JEV client pins Decisions + typesafe/jev-1.13 and ignores unsafe ambient overrides.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional source-capture model. Grok is never used for deterministic labels.
GROK_SOURCE_MODEL=x-ai/grok-4.1-fast
# Optional; leave blank or set exactly to the Decisions endpoint:
# OPENROUTER_API_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/alpha/decisions
# Optional; pin scientific arm (do not use chat models or jev-1.13-free):
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=typesafe/jev-1.13
